*> vybe-test: cobol/redefines/test_redefines_partial_view_consistency
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_redefines.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BASE PIC X(6) VALUE "ABCDEF".
01 WS-ALIAS REDEFINES WS-BASE PIC X(2).
01 WS-TAIL PIC X(4) VALUE "WXYZ".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE WS-TAIL TO WS-BASE(3:4).
    DISPLAY WS-ALIAS.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ALIAS DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "AB"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [AB] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-BASE(3:4).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-BASE(3:4) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "WXYZ"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [WXYZ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

